    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiset pipö lïko Asirya akïporyeghö pipö Pilisti ompö kanasyanta Asdod, kintöghoghchini Sarkon nyo kiwowö korononi, aki nyinte nyo kipöytoy pipö Asirya cho pö lïk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kökimwochï ECHOTYON Isaya wero Amos könyis sömök cho kökikuwer kïngwïs sarankwachtin nyo kikörmönö muyenyi nko kweghkachi cho kiloköy. Kwigh lenyoni, akïwestotö kïchïrut amelö kiloköy kwegh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö ECHOTYON, “Kïle wölini köwestotö mötworintenyan Isaya ompö könyis sömök kïchïrut akï puryö kwegh, lïku nyoni kiporunöt nko töngönchin nyo igho ompö koro Misri nko nyo pö Etopya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rötöy pöytoghintö Asirya pikö koroswechoni le odeny kïlïkwï mampustin akïrang chumwak nko poy kïpa kïchïrutöch kimeloköcha kwegh akulak sïro cho mökörtonye löpisöy, ompö arasï nyo pö pipö Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Susöy kïgh, akïlalïyan pïchoni kökikutö kikönötengwa koro Etopya, akïkwolö kegh owesyo Misri otini kewonyeghö chane kikönötengwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini ketï asisoni, kïlö pich cho möngöy sörömu nanampa koro Pilisti, ‘Arose kïgh nyo kegha ompö pïchay kökikönecha lö köghetenecha pöytoghinto Asirya! Ekengötunecha ompö or ne köny?’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sïwïyaghpa rulöto Papilon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
